window.products.push({"id":1183027,"name":"FARYODI iPad Pro 12.9 Case with Keyboard (6th 2022 Gen/5th 2021 Gen) 360 Rotatable Backlit Keyboard with Trackpad & Pencil Holder for iPad Pro12.9 4th","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MsaOxLCuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<Well-spaced Keys and Sensitive Touchpad> The iPad Pro 12.9 keyboard has laptop-like well-spaced keys, shortcut keys, and a built-in touchpad for enhanced control and comfort of use. The keyboard system has defined multi-gesture control. Using the iPad in a new way is convenient for you to edit documents, browse the web and make presentations, no additional mouse is required. Notice: Please Upgrade your iPad software to iPadOS13.4 to fully access the touchpad function! <A New Backlight Experience> This newly upgraded ipad pro 12.9 keyboard case farewell to the monotonous monochrome backlight, and designed a more interesting rainbow-light backlit keyboard. With 3 brightness adjust modes, it is more user-friendly and meets the needs of typing in a variety of environments. When the keyboard is not used for a long time, the keyboard will enter the smart sleep mode and the backlight will be off. When you press any key, the backlight will light up again. <7 Using Models> This iPad Pro 12.9 keyboard supports 360-degree Rotation and 180-degree Flip(Withstand 20,000 cycle stress-tested) provides an infinite viewing angle. You can adjust the screen to any comfortable angle when you are watching videos, playing games, or simply typing. While you are showing your presentation or in the business meeting, this keyboard case would be a great helper in every scene you could imagine. <Precise Cutout and Apple Pencil Holder> The iPad Pro 12.9 Case with Keyboard has a precise cutout that allows full access to iPad Pro 12.9 inch all ports, sensors, speakers, microphones, and cameras. At the same time, the tablet case comes with a special pencil holder compatible with an Apple tablet stylus for a more compact design. Insert the Apple Pencil directly into the pen slot, and you can directly charge the Apple Pencil that supports wireless charging. <Turn Your Tablet Into a Laptop in One Step> The iPad keyboard case was designed for the iPad Pro 12.9 inch 2022 6th Generation/ 2021 5th Generation (Model number: A2378, A2379, A2461, A2462) / 2020 4th Generation (Model number: A2229, A2069, A2232, A2233) / 2018 3rd Generation (Model number: A1876, A2014, A1895, A1983). Put your 12.9 inch iPad into a FARYODI keyboard case, you will have a comfortable laptop-like typing experience. Please check the model number of your tablet before purchase. <After-sales Service>★★★FARYODI provides you with 24-hour email contact service & 1-year worry-free warranty & 30-day replacement or full refund. . If you have any problems, please click on the history order to contact us at any time. Package List: 1 x 12.9 inch ipad pro case with keyboard; 1 x USB Charging Cable; 1 x User Manual;1 x Trackpad Gesture Description V3.0.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MsaOxLCuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FARYODI","source_asin":"B09FFCZRJ1","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183027","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FFCZRJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FFCZRJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
