window.products.push({"id":1183055,"name":"Samsung SC-MX20 Flash Memory Camcorder w/34x Optical Zoom (Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BfcFAf8pS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer The MX20 makes it easy to capture everything you want to remember and some you might want to forget. It features an optimized recording mode for YouTube, a Schneider Lens with 34x optical zoom, image stabilization and face detection. You can also record up to 16 hours using a 32 GB memory card. The SAMSUNG SC-MX20 also features the longest battery life in its class, lasting up to three hours. Samsung SC-MX20 Highlights Shoot in either 4:3 or 16:9 aspect ratio Flexible recording and viewing By offering a choice of shooting in two different aspect ratios - 4:3 and 16:9 - SAMSUNG ensures the entire image is captured for playback on everything from older TVs to your newest, wide-format HDTV screen. 680K pixel video CCD delivers high resolution video images with superior color resolution and detail. It surpasses the conventional camcorder with digital quality and its PC interface. Use the memory type of your choice Twice the memory options The external memory slot accepts both SD and MMC. Play videos, transfer images, music and documents quickly and easily using the memory type of your choice. Capture farther than the eye can see With its high quality 34x optical zoom lens you can get close to the action from a safe distance. And for those ultra long distance shots, the 1200x digital zoom will let you see it all in perfect detail. Advanced image stabilization minimizes unwanted picture shaking caused by hand movement during recording. USB 2.0 interface The SC-MX20 has a USB port for easy uploading of MPEG4 movie clips and JPEG still images to your PC. What's in the box : Samsung SC-MX20 Camcorder Samsung SC-MX20 Camcorder AC Adapter/Charger AC Adapter/Charger Battery Pack Battery Pack Hand Grip Hand Grip AV Cable AV Cable USB Cable USB Cable Instruction CD Instruction CD","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BfcFAf8pS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMSUNG","source_asin":"B001FA1OHW","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183055","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001FA1OHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B001FA1OHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
