window.products.push({"id":1183079,"name":"LINKUP – [40Gbps Certified Cat8 Ethernet Patch Cable Double Shielded┃2000MHz (2GHz) Cat8.1┃Future Proof LAN Wires Compatible with Cat7A, Cat7, Cat6A, ","category":"electronics","retail price":50.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RN9tTKheL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【True Cat8 Performance】Certified by the industrial leading network analyzer (Fluke Versiv DSX-8000) to ensure 40Gbps performance, 2GHz frequency, and up to 40Gbps in data transfer. Constructed using 26AWG stranded copper conductor wiring, individually foiled pairs with aluminum shielding & overall cable screen shielding provides the basis for extreme reliability and blazing fast connections. Certified according to specification Class I in according with IOS/IEC 11801-1 Ed. 1.0 up to 2GHz. 【Highest Standard】Compliant with ANSI/TIA568.2-D Category 8, ISO/IEC TR11801 Class I, IEC61156-9 Cat.8.1, Flammability rating at UL444 CM or CMR, IEC60332-1-2, IEC60332-3-24, LSZH Acidity: IEC60754-2, Smoke Density: IEC60332-3-24. RoHS supporting 10BASE-T, 100BASE-TX (Fast Ethernet) 1000BASE-T/1000BASE-TX (Gigabit Ethernet), 10GBASE-T (10-Gigabit Ethernet) and 25GBASE-T (40 GbE). 【Next Gen】Next generation 40G network systems are ideal for corporate network systems, datacenters, broadcast stations, media/video servers, & those with extreme high-speed networking needs. *** This highly double shielded wires may not work with some non-10G equipment which cause “Antenna Effect” bottlenecking network speed (down to less than 100mbps). Please contact us for devices that are not supported. 【Highly Compatible】Common RJ45 24K gold plated plugs allow you to connect a wide variety of devices. Great for use with: PS5, NAS, VoIP, PoE, PoE+ (Power Over Ethernet Plus), PC/Mac, Routers, Cable Modems, Printers/Scanners, or entertainment systems like PlayStations, Xbox or for audiophile audio equipment. Warning: Please avoid \"FLAT\" and THIN cables as they all failed in the 10Gbps speed tests and failed for the LINKUP connector to cut through the wires to make good contact. Other recommended premium Cat8 products:【Certified Cat8 Bulk Cable: B07JQ2GSFQ】【Certified Tool-less Plugs: B07BN3SZPM】【Certified Tool-less Keystones: B08BCR14DB】【Pressing Tools: B07JQ61FYS】","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RN9tTKheL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINKUP","source_asin":"B08PZCZ78C","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183079","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PZCZ78C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PZCZ78C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
