window.products.push({"id":1183101,"name":"TEKFUN 2 Pack LCD Writing Tablet for Kids, 8.5 Inch Doodle Board Drawing Board Reusable Drawing Tablet with Lanyard, Educational Kids Toddler Toys Bir","category":"electronics","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KmXsJp+YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【💕 2 Pack for More Fun】TEKFUN 2 Pack doodle board is a wonderful choice for twins and multi-children families. The cool lock feature helps keep content and prevents accidentally erasing. Pressing the erase button can clear the screen in just a second. With the lanyard, no need to worry about the stylus lost. Package includes:8.5\" LCD writing tablet *2 + stylus *2+ stylus lanyard*2 + user manual + gift box package + product warranty. 【📖 Learning Educational Toys】With the TEKFUN drawing board, parents can guide children to draw, doodle, write, calculate, spell words and play tic-tac-toe. Kids' patience, creativity, imagination, and hand-eye coordination skills could be better improved. Bring kids a better preschool or homeschool learning experience. 【🎨 Kids Travel Essentials Games】0.24 kg weight + 8.5-inch size of drawing pads, even toddlers can carry them around! Easily put into school bags, handbags, travel bags or the pocket behind the seat. Suitable for multiple occasions, such as road trips, car travel, airplane, restaurant, church, at daycare. Keep kids occupied on the go or in any waiting rooms. 【👋 Zero-Mess Coloring】 With the one-click erase feature, the Tekfun doodle board can be used more than 10,000 times, so your child can enjoy endless doodling without any mess. without colored pencils and crayons, you no longer need to worry about kids ruining your walls and sofa. Fareware the mess of traditional painting modes and keep your home clean! 【💝 Perfect Kids Gift Choice】TEKFUN LCD writing tablet would be a perfect gift for kids on any occasion.No matter for birthdays, Christmas, Easter, Valentine's Day, back-to-school supplies, etc. Encourage kids to develop their imagination and let them draw whatever comes to their minds. A suitable gift toy for 3 4 5 6 7-year-old boys and girls. Multi-use for all age groups, even toddlers, children, teens, or adults.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KmXsJp+YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEKFUN","source_asin":"B0C4TP4BLK","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183101","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4TP4BLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4TP4BLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1183102,"name":"Gekkoscience R909 Bitcoin SHA256 USB Pod Miner 1.5TH","category":"electronics","retail price":600.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LOIdAhS-L.jpg","description":"This miner is built with the same physical dimensions as the R606 so anything built around them would still fit this unit. Airflow ducting is the same, same 80mm fan. However, you’ll notice ports and jacks are located at the exhaust end instead of accessible from the side. Designed to be stackable, you no longer have to keep three sides clear – two for airflow and one for cabling. The R909 has been upgraded with a better main regulator and improved thermal management. Heatsink area over the chips is increased by 40% over the R606.The Terminus R909 needs an external controller running cgminer, with USB connection to the miner (a 6-foot USB cable will be included with purchase). The driver has been tested extensively on linux PC and Raspberry Pi. Like previous Terminus models, the miner runs on 12V power from either a standard 2.1/5.5mm barrel jack (rated for 8A) or a PCIe 6-pin jack.The \"stock\" speed will be set to 400MHz, expected to see 1.6TH, but higher frequencies are possible.This miner also features Blinky Lights, but they're not as intrusive as previous models of pod or stick. The rate of blinking is proportional to hashrate. The base light color is a delightful pink-magenta.The BM1397 chips have a significant temperature coefficient, which means that they pull noticeably more power as they get warmer. Nobody at GekkoScience will be offended if a tuner or enthusiast upgrades the fan, as more airflow could mean reducing power consumption by 5-10% just from maintaining lower temperatures. These units take a standard 80mmx25mm 3/4-wire 12V case fan. And like all GekkoScience products, the Terminus R909 is Made In The USA. Approximate dimensions: 3.5 x 4.2 x 6 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LOIdAhS-L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASICMiner","source_asin":"B0BQZ35B6G","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183102","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQZ35B6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQZ35B6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
