window.products.push({"id":1183162,"name":"Canon PowerShot S410 4MP Digital Elph with 3x Optical Zoom","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C8E2K9S6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description CANON POWERSHOT-S410CH, 4.0 MEGAPIXEL DIGITAL CAMERA WITH 1.5 L Amazon.com Sleek, powerful, and eminently portable, the Canon PowerShot S410 4MP Digital ELPH with 3x Optical Zoom offers the ultimate in contemporary style and advanced features. Memorable images are a click away with a high-resolution sensor, 3x optical zoom lens, and impressive capabilities that are as easy to use as they are advanced. Sharp, Highly Detailed Resolution: 4.0-Megapixel CCD The PowerShot S410 digital camera is equipped with high-resolution CCD sensors, or charged coupled device sensors, that convert light information into the image you ultimately capture. The CCD sensors featured in the PowerShot S410 mean that you'll be sure to capture a wealth of detail with every shot, so that even your largest prints will exhibit the clarity and richness of detail that you demand. Combined Optical/Digital Zoom This camera is equipped with a high-resolution 3x optical zoom lens that will give you the sharp shooting that you'll need for a variety of situations. Combined with the 6x digital zoom, you'll be integrated seamlessly into the action for those perfect shots. DIGIC Image Processor and iSAPS Technology Canon's exclusive DIGIC Image Processor revolutionizes how you shoot digital by processing images faster and improving the accuracy of the auto-focus. By also reducing the effects of noise in your images, DIGIC assures you that you'll get the precise images you expect with every shot. Nine-point AiAF Intelligent Orientation Sensor No matter where your subject appears in the frame, the Nine-point AiAF ensures crisp, fast focus with every shot. An intelligent orientation sensor automatically rotates images to the correct orientation when you view them on the LCD screen or your computer. Record High-quality Movies with Sound In addition to taking crisp, clear and amazingly rich stills, the PowerShot S410 lets you capture up to three minutes of movies at QVGA (320 x 240 pixels) or QQVGA (160 x 120) resolution (at 15 frames per second). The Powershot S410 incorporates years of Canon's legendary status as a leading maker of cameras into a compact digital camera that will fit into the palm of your hand but give you a world of outstanding photo opportunities. Included with the camera is a battery charger, rechargeable battery pack, and 32 MB of flash memory. What's in the Box PowerShot S410, battery charger (CB-2LS), wrist strap, compact flash card (CF-32M), ArcSoft Camera Suite CD-ROM, Digital Camera Solution CD-ROM, battery pack (NB-1LH), interface cable, and AV cable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C8E2K9S6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Canon","source_asin":"B0002YF2LQ","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183162","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002YF2LQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002YF2LQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
