window.products.push({"id":1183169,"name":"PATA Optical Drive (Superdrive) Enclosure for Mac laptops","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21v2A-jlHqL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is a PATA Optical Drive (Superdrive) Enclosure for Mac laptops except for the Macbook Unibody models. This enclosure will allow you to make your internal optical drive (combo drive or superdrive) an external drive. This is a bare enclosure. No drive is installed. This can be used if you want the ability to have two optical drives, or if you want to use one of our DualDrives to have two internal hard drives and have your optical drive as an external device. The drive uses USB 2.0. In some machines, it will require two USB ports (one for the connection and one for additional power.) If you install the drive that is currently in your machine, then the drive will not have a bezel once mounted into the external enclosure. This is solely cosmetic, and the drive will function the same with or without a bezel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21v2A-jlHqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Apple","source_asin":"B003FW0OTC","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183169","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003FW0OTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B003FW0OTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1183170,"name":"Wingscapes WSCA04 Timelapse Outdoor PlantCam (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DtFtw1odL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Watch Your Garden Growing in Fast-Forward! The Timelapse PlantCam automatically creates movies of your plants in fast-forward! This weatherproof, digital camera takes photos or videos at set time intervals. It automatically stitches together still photos to create a seamless movie of an event that is normally too slow to see with the naked eye. Also great for parties, weather or construction! Amazon.com Watch your plants grow in fast-forward with the Timelapse PlantCam. The PlantCam is rugged and weatherproof, and automatically takes photos and videos at set time intervals. It then stitches the photos together to create a video showing in minutes or seconds what usually can't be seen with the naked eye. The result is a seamless movie of your plants growing. Key Features Easy to use right out of the box Easy to use right out of the box Rugged, weatherproof construction can be left unattended Rugged, weatherproof construction can be left unattended Takes still photos or videos, close-up or landscape Takes still photos or videos, close-up or landscape Lets you see what is normally too slow to view Lets you see what is normally too slow to view Connects easily to your computer or television Connects easily to your computer or television Makes it easy to share your movies through e-mail or post online Makes it easy to share your movies through e-mail or post online Records data to internal memory (16MB) or a memory card (not included)  The Timelapse PlantCam can also be used to create movies of parties, construction, weather or other events. The PlantCam makes it possible to see a fast-forward view of processes that are normally too slow to see. Timelapse Photography Made Easy Whether you're interested in garden photography or creating your own movies, timelapse technology offers an innovative view of any sequential event. To create a timelapse movie, simply set the camera to take still photos at the desired time interval—immediately, 30 seconds, 1 minute, 5 minutes, 10 minutes, 15 minutes, 30 minutes, 1 hour, 3 hours, 6 hours, or once a day. It will automatically turn on after each interval countdown, take a photo, then return to battery conservation mode. After you are finished taking photos in timelapse mode, simply set the camera to \"Convert to Movie\" and it does the work for you! High-Quality Garden Photos and Videos With 4.0 megapixels, the Timelapse PlantCam takes crisp, clear still photos and video clips. The sturdy, weatherproof construction doesn't interfere with the camera's operation or picture quality. Plus, the photos are high enough resolution to create beautiful prints! View, Save, or Share In Seconds! The PlantCam doesn't require any special software for viewing photos. It can connect directly to your television or computer, or you can simply transfer from the optional memory card. Photos and videos download in standard formats for viewing, printing, e-mailing or posting online.  Requires: Four AA batteries (not included) Records data to internal memory (16MB) or a memory card (not included) The Timelapse PlantCam can also be used to create movies of parties, construction, weather or other events. The PlantCam makes it possible to see a fast-forward view of processes that are normally too slow to see. Timelapse Photography Made Easy Whether you're interested in garden photography or creating your own movies, timelapse technology offers an innovative view of any sequential event. To create a timelapse movie, simply set the camera to take still photos at the desired time interval—immediately, 30 seconds, 1 minute, 5 minutes, 10 minutes, 15 minutes, 30 minutes, 1 hour, 3 hours, 6 hours, or once a day. It will automatically turn on after each interval countdown, take a photo, then return to battery conservation mode. After you are finished taking photos in timelapse mode, simply set the camera to \"Convert to Movie\" and it does the work for you! High-Quality Garden Photos and Videos With 4.0 megapixels, the Timelapse PlantCam takes crisp, clear still photos and video clips. The sturdy, weatherproof construction doesn't interfere with the camera's operation or picture quality. Plus, the photos are high enough resolution to create beautiful prints! View, Save, or Share In Seconds! The PlantCam doesn't require any special software for viewing photos. It can connect directly to your television or computer, or you can simply transfer from the optional memory card. Photos and videos download in standard formats for viewing, printing, e-mailing or posting online. Requires: Four AA batteries (not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DtFtw1odL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wingscapes","source_asin":"B002M2TLLI","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183170","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002M2TLLI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B002M2TLLI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
