window.products.push({"id":1183350,"name":"Tascam DR-40 4-Track Handheld Digital Audio Recorder (Silver) with Tascam Handheld DR-Series Recording Accessory Package + SanDisk 16 GB SDHC + Fibert","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jk5idyQyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tascam DR-40 4-Track Handheld Digital Audio Recorder High quality audio recording is achieved with the Tascam DR-40 4-Track Handheld Digital Audio Recorder. The DR-40 offers a remarkable combination of compact, durable design with professional-level features. It records to SD or SDHC flash memory cards up to 320 kbps, and WAV/BWF files at rates up to 24-bit/96 kHz. With built-in condenser microphones you can choose an X/Y or A/B stereo pattern and a built-in speaker allows you to play back your recordings instantly for review. In addition to peak limiting and a low cut filter the DR-40 offers Dual Recording Mode which records a backup copy that will never be distorted. The microphone’s XLR & 1/4\" input can accept balanced microphone or line inputs and the preamp includes phantom power for detailed recordings with condenser microphones. The DR-40 can operate for up to 15 hours from 3 standard AA batteries and can use USB power via the included cable. Handheld DR-Series Recording Accessory Package The package provides the necessary accessories that work hand in hand with the DR-40 for professional-sounding recordings. Included is a furry windscreen to avoid even the slightest wind noise from entering the mic, a grip to reduce handling noise, a power adapter that is convenient for continuous recording, and a soft carrying case. Transcend 16 GB SDHC With a 16 GB memory card the DR-40 is ready to get started. Fibertique Cleaning Cloth This microfiber cleaning cloth is made with fibertique technology and is designed to help maintain the good shape of electronic devices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jk5idyQyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tascam","source_asin":"B01N7BQQXW","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183350","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N7BQQXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N7BQQXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
