window.products.push({"id":1183359,"name":"Acer B326HK ymjdpphz 32-inch UHD 4K2K (3840 x 2160) Widescreen Monitor with ErgoStandch Screen LED-Lit Monitor","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m0F5-dOcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The stunning Acer B6 Series monitor combines professional style with ergonomic design to suit all environments and viewing demands. From the 32-inch display with an Ultra HD (4K2K) resolution to the superior 100 Million:1 contrast ratio your presented with detailed imagery for viewing photos, browsing the web and the large screen also makes viewing documents side by side easy. Plus, 100% sRGB, Acer color and Comfy View technologies make every pixel colorful and close to true colors. Its VESA compatible mounting offers a sleek, space saving option in tight spaces and power-saving technologies conserve cost and resources. Amazon.com The stunning Acer B326HK monitor combines professional style with ergonomic design to suit all environments and viewing demands. From the 32-inch display with an Ultra HD (4K2K) resolution to the superior 100 Million:1 contrast ratio your presented with detailed imagery for viewing photos, browsing the web and the large screen also makes viewing documents side by side easy. Plus, 100% sRGB, Acer eColor and ComfyView technologies make every pixel colorful and close to true colors. Its VESA compatible mounting offers a sleek, space saving option in tight spaces and power-saving technologies conserve cost and resources. Key Features Viewable Area: 32” Viewable Area: 32” Panel Type: IPS Panel Type: IPS Resolution: 3840 x 2160 (native and maximum) Resolution: 3840 x 2160 (native and maximum) Aspect Ratio: 16:9 Aspect Ratio: 16:9 Contrast Ratio: 100 Million:1 MAX (ACM) Contrast Ratio: 100 Million:1 MAX (ACM) Brightness: 350 cd/m2 Brightness: 350 cd/m2 Response Time: 6ms Response Time: 6ms Refresh Rate: 60Hz Refresh Rate: 60Hz Signal Inputs: 1 x Display Port, 1 x DVI (w/HDCP, 1 x MHL & 1 x Mini Display Port Signal Inputs: 1 x Display Port, 1 x DVI (w/HDCP, 1 x MHL & 1 x Mini Display Port Ports: 5 - USB 3.0 Ports (1 Up, 4 Down) Ports: 5 - USB 3.0 Ports (1 Up, 4 Down) Speakers: 2 speakers, 2 watts per speaker Speakers: 2 speakers, 2 watts per speaker Weight: 26.45 lbs. Weight: 26.45 lbs. Learn More Ultra Resolution The B6326HK monitor has 4K2K resolution (3840 x 2160) which is 4 times the 1080p resolution! Enjoy stunning, high quality images with excellent detail.  The rapid 6ms response time deliver high-quality moving images bringing immersive graphics to your movies and games. The large 32\" anti-glare screen makes photos come to life while also providing a single screen for work efficiency’s.  The B326HK monitor features an impressive 100 million: 1 contrast ratio (MAX ACM) radiating the brightest whites and deepest blacks ensuring a crystal-clear viewing experience.  This screen implements wide color gamut technology presenting real, natural colors. The 6-axis color adjustment feature ensures the screen shows the highest standard and color accuracy. Productive Connectivity The ErgoStand tilts for the best viewing angle while the height can be adjusted for different desk heights with a simple push or lift.  The display has 5 high-speed USB 3.0 ports which provide a convenient spot to connect your mouse, keyboard or a mobile phone for a quick charge. The DVI-D input with High-bandwidth Digital Content Protection (HDCP) allows for viewing of digital movies and copy-protected media. Comfortable View The 32\" Display comes encased in an stylish bezel matched with a sturdy black base. The ErgoStand tilts for the best viewing angle while the height can be adjusted for different desk heights with a simple push or lift.  The mercury-free 32\" LCD display is designed to meet Energy Star® standards reducing energy costs and conserving energy.  Connect two working system into monitor for multi-tasking at its finest with Picture in Picture technology.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m0F5-dOcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Acer","source_asin":"B00PDOBUGQ","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183359","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PDOBUGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PDOBUGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
