window.products.push({"id":1183416,"name":"3 Channel Dash Cam Front and Rear Inside, 1080P Dash Camera for Cars Three Way Triple Car Camera with IR Night Vision,Loop Recording, G-Sensor, 24H Pa","category":"electronics","retail price":38.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g-f1TWFSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Three Channel Front Inside Rear Dash Cam】The three-channel driving recorder provides a front camera, an interior camera and a rear camera, which can monitor the front, rear and interior of the vehicle, and can choose different screen viewing modes, while providing 1080P+1080P+1080P video. This 3 Channel dash cam comes with a 32 GB SD Card and small spudger, whose premium performance allows dash cams to run longer. 【IR Night Vision&Adjustable Brightness】:Built-in 4 IR night vision LEDs make dash cam records a clearer video in the low-light environment. The inside-facing camera can accurately capture the driver and passengers even when the car interior is completely dark, perfect for ride share drivers such as Uber, Lyft, and Taxi.The touch screen adjusts the exposure for comfortable viewing during the day and night. 【Loop Recording &Accident Lock】:Loop recording will overwrite the oldest videos when the SD card is full and make sure the dash cam continuous recording. Built-in G-sensor,when a sudden shake/collision of the car is detected.The dash cam will automatically start recording for 30 seconds.The accident video will be locked and will not be overwritten. 【Motion Detection&Parking Monitor for collisions, theft, and vicious scratch】: With the motion detection mode, the dash cam will be on standby mode until motion is detected, the dash cam will wake up and start recording once the front camera detects objection movement.When the dash cam detects a collision happens, it will auto power on then record a protected video. 24 Hours recording: the dash cam will go on recording after your car is parked (need connect to hardwire kit,not included). 【Hidden design and easy installation of car dash cam】：1 x Car DVR,1 x Bracket,1 x Car charger,1 x User Manual,1 x Rear camera,1x32 GB SD Card.Unique compact dash cam, dash cam combines three cameras into one compact size. It won't block your view or distract you while driving. The rear camera is easy to install, and the reversing light does not need to be disassembled, and it can be used after connecting with the front lens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g-f1TWFSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMprime","source_asin":"B0BBFZ6963","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183416","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBFZ6963","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBFZ6963","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
