window.products.push({"id":1183439,"name":"Pyle White 400 Watt Outdoor Portable Wireless PA Loud speaker System with Rechargeable Battery, Auxiliary RCA jack for ipod, Microphone Jack, USB / SD","category":"electronics","retail price":255.32,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NH7Hb6rfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The PCMX265W Portable PA System from Pyle Pro is an all-in-one DJ mixer, PA, and digital music player on wheels. It's perfect for traveling performers because it's easily transportable, and plugs into your wall outlet for convenient use. This device is equipped with three sets of input jacks, so you can sing, play guitar, and pipe in music from your digital music player all at the same time if you want. The combo XLR-1/4' jack is perfect for microphones. And the stereo RCA ports are compatible with any digital music player. Plus, each input has its own independent gain control. There's more: it's also equipped with a USB port and SD card slot, so you can pipe in your favorite digital music. Then, use the built-in DJ controls including cue, reverse, loop, and pitch control to bend the music to your will. The built-in 400-watt speaker isn't lacking for power, either. But if you need a bigger sound, use the ¼' output jack to connect this unit to a bigger speaker or mixer. Features: * One Combo XLR/TRS (1/4'') Jack For Balanced Microphone * One 1/4\" Jack For Instrument Or Microphone * Auxiliary RCA Jacks For External Music Player (CD Player, iPod) * Play MP3 Files From SD Card Or USB Stick * Easily Navigate Folders Of Music Using The Built-In Controls * Powerful DJ Controls, Including Cue, Reverse, Loop (In, Out, Re-Loop), Pitch Control * Each Input Has Its Own Independent Gain Control * Master Gain Control * Link Output To Connect To An External Speaker Via 1/4'' Jack * Peak Power: 400 W MAX * Standard Pole Mount: 3.15'' Depth, 1.40'' Diameter * 110/220 V Switchable * Dimensions: 13.8'' W X 16.9'' H X 9.64'' D * Color: White —— SATISFACTION GUARANTEED —— Your satisfaction is our #1 priority. If this item fails to meet your expectations we will accept it back a full refund within the first 30 days. We also stand behind this product with a limited 1-Year manufacturer's warranty. Contact us If the item should show any defect within the first year we will help exchange it for a new one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NH7Hb6rfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pyle","source_asin":"B006O64J38","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183439","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006O64J38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B006O64J38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
