window.products.push({"id":1183586,"name":"Smart Watch for Men Women Fitness - Smartwatch 1.3\" Round Touch Screen IP68 Waterproof Activity Tracker with Heart Rate Sleep Monitor Digital Watches ","category":"electronics","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XCJrTmhVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional: Equipped with 1.3 inch touch screen and custom wallpaper. After connecting your smartwatch to your phone, you can choose from over 40 wallpapers or choose your own image to set as your unique wallpaper. Canspot smartwatches have useful features like sedentary reminders, alarm clock, countdown timer, stopwatch, remote phone camera and find your phone, weather forecast, and more. The display automatically lights up when you raise your wrist. 24 Sports Modes Smartwatch: The smartwatch accurately tracks your activities. The watch has 24 custom training modes (ball games/treadmill/swimming record/cycling/yoga, etc.). It tracks your activities in real time, such as steps, calories burned, kilometers traveled. Men's and women's smartwatches can connect to your smartphone's GPS to track your speed and distance traveled. By pressing the \"sports button\" on the watch, you can switch to sports mode in a second. Message notifications and durable battery: Whenever you receive notifications from your smartphone, such as text messages, incoming calls or APP notifications, your smartwatch will vibrate gently to remind you of important messages and notifications. You can also personalize app notifications you want to sync or not in App GloryFit. Also, Canspot Men's Ladies Watches have excellent battery life of up to 10-15 days. Charging time is about 2-3 hours. Heart Rate and Sleep Monitor: The smart watch accurately monitors your heart rate in real time through the optical sensor, 24 hours continuously, calories, steps will also be recorded in the smart watch throughout the day. All data will also be recorded in the smartwatch throughout the day for over 30 days. Based on your heart rate, sleep duration and level of irritability, personalised data can help you instantly improve your sleep quality and lifestyle. IP67 Waterproof Strap Interchangeable Strap: The smart watch is compatible with at least Android 4.4 and iOS 8.0. Water resistant to 5 meters, you can wear the watch while swimming, bathing and washing your hands without worry (not suitable for use in hot and salty environments). The smartwatch comes with 2 straps, which means you don't need to buy replacements. The strap is very easy to install and remove.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XCJrTmhVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zngzex","source_asin":"B0B9XSP8V6","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183586","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9XSP8V6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9XSP8V6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
