window.products.push({"id":1183695,"name":"Yamaha PSR S900 Arranger 61 Key Arranger Workstation Keyboard","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416zBIJFYqL._AC_.jpg","description":"The PSR-S900 gives you the same ultra high quality sounds found on their top of the line models and features a newly designed panel layout that makes operating and playing exceptionally easy and intuitive. All panel controls and buttons are right in front of you, logically arranged for optimum performing convenience allowing you to seamlessly switch settings as you play. The new USB audio recording feature makes it incredibly easy to capture your entire performance including your singing, and files are saved as wave files for porting to a computer. Want more? Theres Super Articulation Voices for incredibly realistic instrument sounds, 5.7\" color screen, mic input with 3-part vocal harmony, video out, MegaVoices for enhanced playback of the built-in Styles, organ flutes that use modeling technology, USB to DEVICE for connecting hard drives, thumb drives and floppy disk drives and a LAN port for connecting the keyboard directly to the Internet for on-line, on-demand music. And finally, there are still features that even a beginner would appreciate like performance assistant technology for song playback that, when enabled, insures that even a non-player cannot make a mistake. Top quality sounds, amazing ease of operation and performance — the PSR-S900 has it all. USB Audio Recorder Here's one of the most impressive new features of the PSR-S900 — the USB audio recorder. It allows you to directly record the sound of the instrument to an optional USB drive as digital audio data for pristine, absolutely noise-free audio quality. Naturally, you can record your voice, guitar or other acoustic and electric instruments as well, and mix them with the PSR-S900 sound. Once complete, transfer your files to your computer and share your music. Imagine going from a brilliant idea to a recorded CD in minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416zBIJFYqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YAMAHA","source_asin":"B000X4GGV0","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183695","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000X4GGV0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000X4GGV0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
