window.products.push({"id":1183793,"name":"ELUTENG PCIE 1 to 4 Ports PCI Express 16X Slots Riser Card USB 3.0 PCI-E Adapter Board Multiplier Port GPU Extender Miner Riser Card for BTC Bitcoin M","category":"electronics","retail price":15.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710YSNZpKML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PCI-E 1 to 4 Riser Card】The bus interface is PCI-E X1, and compatible with X4, X8, X16 graphics interface, 1 interface can be expanded to 4 USB3.0 ports, which effectively solves the problem that the lack of PCIe interface on the motherboard. NOTE: The adapter card cannot be connected to USB devices, since the 4 USB ports transfer PCI-E signals, not USB signals. 【Ultra-Large Aluminum Heatsink】The ultra-large imported aluminum alloy heatsink can effectively dissipate excess heat, so that the adapter card is always at a normal temperature, and the operation is more stable. 【Plug-in Design】The PCI-E riser card adopts a plug-in design, which is directly connected to the motherboard interface for power supply. It can be fixed on the chassis without an extension cable, reducing the number of adapters and patch cords, effectively reducing interface interference and line loss, and ensuring data reliability and stability, improve work efficiency. 【Strong Stability】The main control board adopts the PCI-E interface for direct power supply, without an external power cord, so that the main control board is not interfered by the outside world. 4 USB 3.0 ports can work at the same time, backward compatible with USB 2.0 and USB 1.0, the stability is higher. 【Wide Compatibility】The total interface supports PCIE X1 / X4 / X8 / X16 graphics card interface. The interface supports USB3.0 and is backward compatible with USB 2.0/1.0. Support DOS, LINUX, WINXP, WIN7, WIN8, WIN10 and other systems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710YSNZpKML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELUTENG","source_asin":"B09DCZGGHV","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183793","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DCZGGHV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DCZGGHV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
