window.products.push({"id":1183955,"name":"SITHON Laptop Shoulder Bag for 14-inch MacBook Pro M2/M1 Pro/Max 2023 2021, 13'' MacBook Air/Pro M2 M1, Surface Pro 9/8/X, Water-Resistant Shockproof ","category":"electronics","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tIwHTgazS._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Imported Compatibility: Compatible with 14.2-inch MacBook Pro (M2/M1 Pro/Max) A2779 A2442 2023 2021, 13.6\" MacBook Air A2681 M2 Chip 2022, 13.3\" MacBook Air A2337 M1 A2179 A1932, for MacBook Pro Retina 13 (2016-2020) A2251 / A2289 / A2159 / A1989 / A1706 / A1708, for Microsoft Surface Pro 9 / Pro 8 / Pro X / Pro 7 / Pro 6 / Pro 5 / Pro 4 / Pro 3 / Pro LTE, and for Dell/Asus/Acer/Toshiba/Lenovo Notebooks/Tablets up to 13\" Large Capacity: One main compartment for your laptop / tablet. An independent compartment for storage your electronic essentials, tablet, phone, cables, power bank, mouse, notebook, passport etc. Two outer side pockets organizer accessories paperwork, hold daily essentials. Two zipper outer pockets (one features with keychain hook) keep your essentials well in place. You will always be able to find what you need, when you need it. A really good choice for travel and everyday use. Water Resistant & Shock Absorption: Water repellent & wear-resistant exterior with shockproof soft foam air cushion interior prevents potential scratches, with high quality zipper, durable enough for a long lasting. Laptop/Tablet Protection: The bag comes with corner protection design at the bottom corners of the main laptop/tablet compartment, and features ultra-thick, soft and protective cushioning inside and around the compartment zipper, provides great protection against scratches, drops and bumps. Multiple Carrying Ways: Features with concealable PU leather hand strap, you can change from this tablet sling bag to tablet sleeve case, providing a more flexible carrying experience to office workers and students. Come with removable adjustable shoulder strap, this laptop case bag can be carried as a messenger bag or briefcase, enable you to carry your laptop and accessories conveniently for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tIwHTgazS._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SITHON","source_asin":"B095SGSQHB","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183955","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095SGSQHB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B095SGSQHB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1183956,"name":"Humminbird 717 5-Inch Waterproof Fishfinder","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F6Zc6h3hS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The 717 gives you the outstanding performance and coverage of DualBeam PLUS sonar, which combines a wide, fish scanning 60 degree beam with a narrow 20 degree beam that gives you a great look at the bottom and structure. The high resolution, 16 level grayscale display provides excellent definition, making it easy to find fish, even in heavy structure, and adjustable contrast enhancement makes it easy to customize the view of your preference. Amazon.com The Humminbird 717 Fish Finder is for serious recreational anglers ready for a step up from traditional fish finders, while still retaining incredible ease of use. The 717 is compact, but full of already built-in capabilities, with the ability to add advanced accessories, making it the perfect companion for your fishing outings. The Humminbird 717 uses DualBeam PLUS sonar, selectable between 20- and 60-degree beams, or simultaneous operation to deliver both wide coverage and better bottom definition up to 1,000 feet with a target separation of only 2.5 inches. This fish finder includes real-time sonar at up to 40 times per second, and Sonar Echo Enhancement sensitive enough to track a jig to over 40 feet. This unit's high-speed, micro-dynamic transducer is reliable up to 70 mph, and even includes water temperature and is speed capable. The 717 has an ultra high-contrast, 5-inch FSTN LCD screen with 320 x 320 lines of resolution in 16-level grayscale for crisp images with high visibility, and an adjustable backlight. The 717 is also capable of upgrading to GPS trackplotting, PC-connection, and a full-screen trackplotter, a 3D track, and a split-screen sonar track with an adjustable split. Despite all its various functions, this unit remains easy to use, and all its advanced upgrades are plug-and-play compatible, from the GPS receiver, to the SmartCast wireless sonar link and PC connection accessories. The Humminbird 717 features real-time flasher performance, Bottom Lock to enhance resolution and separate fish from structure, one-touch zoom with 2x, 4x, 6x and 8x zoom levels, and X-Press Menus so you can access the most important controls with fewer button presses. This fish finder also features both fresh and saltwater options, the ability to choose between TruArch for actual fish returns or selective Fish ID+ with target depth, and Freeze Frame to instantly pause the sonar display, allowing more time to see the details. The 717 comes with a transom mount transducer, and a tilt-and-swivel, quick-disconnect mount system, for either Gimbal or in-dash mounting. This unit measures 6.9 x 7.7 x 4.5 inches (W x H x D) as a Gimbal mount, or when in-dash mounted requires three inches of behind-dash clearance. For upgrades, this system is compatible with optional QuadraBeam Bottom Scanning, and WideSide Bank Scanning Transducers. The Humminbird 717 is built tough with fully gasketed and waterproof construction, and is backed by a manufacturer's one-year warranty. What's in the Box 717 fishing system, transducer, mounting hardware, and product manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F6Zc6h3hS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Humminbird","source_asin":"B000LAD416","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1183956","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000LAD416","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000LAD416","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
